Audited 26 variable-amplitude interpolation declarations, including actual independent finite-mask law differentiation, genuine domination, Gaussian integration by parts and signed scalar coefficients.
The general-amplitude signed-Hessian/Taylor fourth-order restoration and Appendix B analytic budgets remain separate.
